  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "Ce sont les derniers restes du corps\nde Reshiram. On dit qu’ils attendent\nl’apparition d’un héros.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Reshiram’s body was destroyed and\nchanged into this stone. It is said to\nbe waiting for the emergence of a hero.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Reshiram’s body was destroyed and\nchanged into this stone. It is said to\nbe waiting for the emergence of a hero.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "レシラムの　にくたいが　ほろび\nへんかした　すがた。えいゆうの\nとうじょうを　まっていると　される。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "레시라무의 육체가 허물어져\n변화한 모습. 영웅의\n등장을 기다린다고 여겨진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ce sont les derniers restes du corps de Reshiram.\nOn dit qu’ils attendent l’apparition d’un héros.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Nach dem Zerfall seines Körpers nahm Reshiram\ndiese Form an. Man sagt, es warte auf die Ankunft\neines Helden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dispositivo que permite aumentar forzadamente\nlas características de los Pokémon.\nEs un prototipo imperfecto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pietra in cui si è tramutato Reshiram quando\nha perso la sua forma corporea.\nAttende la venuta di un eroe.",
